Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:45:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ABJ: directions button to geolocated customers (Google Maps)

On the phone screen, customers with a geolocation get a round directions
button (arrow icon) that opens the route to the customer in Google Maps
(the Google Maps app on phones):

- check-in customer step: Customers near you, Recently visited, search;
- home: Planned visits and Follow-ups today.

The button never selects the customer nor opens the visit. Server side:
_mobile_partner_vals() returns maps_url and _mobile_vals() returns
partner_maps_url (Google Maps "dir" URL, '' without geolocation).

Version 18.0.1.2.0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDf1bwMVzBpzAmEtw1oK6V
